# Internal notes & dev docs — kept locally only, never pushed to GitHub.
# Public docs live in docs/user/ and stay tracked:
# README, docs/user/PRIVACY_POLICY, RELEASE_NOTES, KNOWN_LIMITATIONS,
# FAQ, SUPPORT, TROUBLESHOOTING, THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.
docs/internal/
# Future internal docs follow the same rule:
*_ARCHITECTURE.md
*_STRATEGY.md
*_INVENTORY.md
*_REPORT.md
THREAT_MODEL*.md
RELEASE_CHECKLIST*.md
RELEASE_BUILD*.md
